# A directory no code decides is a hole in the path, and the file is that name under any directory: the gap shows.
# What the environment holds stands in the term as its hole; it is no place of its own.

route holeenv.run
line entry > run call
known #75 line File(*/report.txt) > run own
line run > Screen own

side entry left
known #75 side File(*/report.txt) left
side Screen right

# the hole is lost and the file falls back to its last literal, a file at the root the code never names
known #75 extra line File(report.txt) > run own
known #75 extra side File(report.txt) left
